        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">This dataset includes rosting of manganese carbonate in a rotary kiln at temperatures around 500°C. Assumption: CO to the atmosphere is equal to the CO after thermal post-combustion (&lt;20mgC/Nm3). No infrastructure for thermal post combustion an no heat through the burning process of CO is calculated.\n\n# Included processes\nThis dataset includes rosting of manganese carbonate in a rotary kiln in a specified nitrogen/oxygen-atmosphere. Energy consumption, carbon monoxide and carbon dioxide emissions to air are calculated. For infrastructure, the ecoinvent dataset "chemical plant, organics" is accounted. Transportation efforts are based on ecoinvent standard estimates.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
